# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — shadow CI 隔离 job 初始化双缺陷：repo 缺 ci/ 基础设施 + bash 在 bash_5.3 子路径 ═══
# Software: 通用（真机 shadow CI 运维，ndppd 0.2.6 实证）
# Gate: r7 轮 L0/L1/L4/L5 pass + L1e 确认（exit 0）
# Status: DRAFT — path B candidate, same-stem .md/.kv pair

id: shadow-ci-repo-source-missing-infra-and-bash-path
severity: 3
category: ci|ohos|build-system|operations
trigger_tool: ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job|build_and_test|run-conan-heavy
phase: ci-init|gate

keywords: ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job, repo-source, can't open input file, build_and_test.sh, 127, ci directory missing, permission denied bash, bash_5.3, bash.org, KC gate, knowledge_check failed, blocked_by_KC, env.sh, PATH, no git device

error_signature: zsh: can't open input file: ci/conan/build_and_test\.sh|build_and_test\.sh:[0-9]+: permission denied: bash|KC: knowledge check failed — blocking build|L[0-9]_RESULT=skip: blocked_by_KC

match_keywords: can't open input file, build_and_test.sh, permission denied: bash, bash_5.3, repo-source, blocked_by_KC, knowledge_check failed

root_cause: |
  (A) ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job.sh 以 --repo-source 复制旧 job repo 时只带包相关顶层目录
  （archives/ knowledge/ 等），不复制 ci/ scripts/ templates/ references/ config/ docs/；
  而 run-conan-heavy.sh 固定 exec `zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh <pkg>` → 文件不存在 → rc=127，
  失败发生在 CI 脚本执行层（区别于 conan-home 缺 remote 的依赖解析层失败）。
  (B) 设备 bash 实际位于 /data/service/hnp/bash.org/bash_5.3/bin——/data/service/hnp/bin 下
  没有 bash（有 cmake/make/clang，与 opencsg 草稿认知不同）。build_and_test.sh:980 的 KC 段用
  裸 `bash knowledge_check.sh` 调用，prepare 生成的 env.sh 默认 PATH 不含 bash_5.3 路径 →
  zsh 报 "permission denied: bash"（PATH 中搜到不可执行副本，易误判为 HMDFS 执行位问题）
  → L0_RESULT=fail: knowledge_check failed，L1-L5 全部 blocked_by_KC。

rec_approach: backfill-repo-infra-dirs-and-prepend-bash-path
rec_description: |
  job 创建后、跑 runner 前一次性补齐：(A) 从任一成功 job 的 repo 用幂等 for 循环 cp -a 补缺失
  顶层目录（ci/ scripts/ templates/ references/ config/ docs/）；(B) 用 base64 整体重写 env.sh
  （HMDFS 上 sed -i 直接失败），PATH 前缀加 /data/service/hnp/bash.org/bash_5.3/bin（对照
  netselect 等成功 job 的 env.sh）。诊断时读 ~/ohos-test-runs/<run-id>/logs/（CI 真实输出），
  而非 job 目录的 logs/stdout.log（恒为 0 字节）。
rec_command: |
  SRC=$HOME/ohos-users/codex/<成功job>/repo/build_in_harmonyos
  DST=$HOME/ohos-users/codex/<新job>/repo/build_in_harmonyos
  cd "$SRC" && for f in * .[!.]*; do [ -e "$f" ] && [ ! -e "$DST/$f" ] && cp -a "$f" "$DST/"; done
  # env.sh 关键行（base64 重写，勿 sed -i）：
  export PATH=/data/service/hnp/bash.org/bash_5.3/bin:$HOME/ohpc-ci-shadow/python-user/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH
rec_auto_fix: false

affected_scope: 所有在无 git 真机上用 ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job.sh --repo-source 创建隔离 job 跑 shadow CI 的库（首次新建 job 必踩）。

verification_cmd: ls DST/ci/conan/build_and_test.sh && grep bash_5.3 <job>/env.sh && nohup sh <job>/run-conan-heavy.sh 后读 ~/ohos-test-runs/<run>/logs/exit-code.txt

authors:
